<title>USA: TENNIS-ATP CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MASON, Ohio 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $2.3</p>
<p>million ATP Championships on Thursday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 16-Patrick Rafter (Australia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Andrei Medvedev 3-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat 3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>14-Albert Costa (Spain) beat 4-Alex Corretja (Spain) 6-1 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
<p>5-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-3 3-6 7-5</p>
<p>6-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>7-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat 9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 7-5</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>10-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Vince Spadea (U.S.) 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
